{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571560/extras/57356bc0c8f2c58d8427ec6e5c26a826.poster.avif?t=1750965387\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571560/extras/57356bc0c8f2c58d8427ec6e5c26a826.webm?t=1750965387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571560/extras/57356bc0c8f2c58d8427ec6e5c26a826.mp4?t=1750965387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Lady Puppet is a Survival Horror Adventure game with emphasis on atmosphere and exploration. It features light puzzle solving sections, stealth sections and a peculiar &quot;doll system&quot; that lets you summon and control companions through the use of &quot;dolls&quot;.<br><br>Play as Lailah Reah, a young and innocent girl, and help her find a way out of Clawhill, a bizarre place where &quot;survivors&quot; have been turned into living marionettes.<br>Use everything you have at your disposal, survive the horror and uncover the mysteries behind Clawhill, the Masked Woman and the Final Autumn.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1571560?t=1750965387","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1571560?t=1750965387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571560/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750965387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571560/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750965387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"conten